Z||000010||Phil||02-09-2000||06:40 AM||||The Lambo just has a 3.2 with a cam. The car when finished will most likely be a little heavier that the stock fiero so I would expect performance to be about like a stock V6. I must admit that driving the 3800 is really getting me spoiled. While my Formula was in the paint shop I had to go back to driving a AWD turbo Laser which I once thought was pretty peppy but now it feels like such a pig. It does have much better traction on snow and wet streets.||||reg||1
